- :attr:`mode`\ `= 'complete'`: Returns `(Q, R)` of shapes `(*, m, m)`, `(*, m, n)` respectively.
  It is differentiable for `m <= n`.
- :attr:`mode`\ `= 'r'`: Computes only the reduced `R`. Returns `(Q, R)` with `Q` empty and `R` of shape `(*, k, n)`.
